From 6d66cc266591c1d049830cce1a90ea679787315f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] NTimeDiagonalizer: factor in-file near-copies

One equation lemma for the hosted clock's tape map (dzClkEmb_eqs) instead of
four; a term-mode dz_initCfg; the branch budget dz_K_bound shared by dz_halts
and dz_accepts_iff; one segment reading dz_seg_read for dz_hQ and the
acceptance lemmas.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
